###1) Completing the square

The number that will help us complete the square is $\left(\dfrac{\blueD{12}}{2}\right)^2=\goldD{36}$:

$\begin{align}
x^2+\blueD{12}x&=13
\\\\
x^2+\blueD{12}x+\goldD{36}&=49&&\text{Add 36.}
\\\\
(x+6)^2&=49&&\text{Factor.}
\end{align}$

[[☃ explanation 1]]
